        },
        {
          "text": "Pele webo, O Betelehemu-Efrata, nekuba kuti uli muniini buyo akati kamikowa ya-Juda, mulinduwe momuyoozwa uuti kaendelezye ba-Israyeli. Kweendeenda kwakwe nkwakalekale, nkwamazuba aaciindi loko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kako uyoobaaba mane kusikila kuciindi cakuzyala cayooyo uuti zyale, elyo babunyina basyeede bayoopiluka kubana ba-Israyeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
